{"sourceUrl":"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/2026/0601/c69701a3168868/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:31.280656+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/2026/0601/c69701a3168868/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span>为加强浙江大学物理学院与国内高水平大学相关院系的交流和联系，使更多的学生能够进一步认识、了解浙大物院，定于<span>2026</span>年<span>7</span>月<span>8</span>日<span>-10</span>日举办<span>“</span>优秀大学生夏令营<span>”</span>。本次夏令营将给优秀大学生提供一个学术互动和交流学习的平台，期间将安排营员聆听科研讲座、参观实验室、与导师和优秀研究生面对面交流等活动。</span></p><p><span>本次夏令营面向全国高校招收营员<span>120</span>名，相关安排及注意事项公告如下：</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>一、</span></span><strong><span>申请资格</span></strong></p><p><span>1.</span><span> </span><span>物理及相关专业本科三年级在校学生（<span>2027</span>年<span>6</span>月毕业）；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><span> </span><span>学习成绩优秀，英语基础扎实（大学英语六级<span>460</span>分及以上，或雅思<span>5.5</span>分及以上，或托福<span>80</span>分及以上优先考虑），对物理专业有浓厚兴趣，并有较强的或潜在的研究能力；</span></p><p><span>3.</span><span> </span><span>遵纪守法，品行端正。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、<span>   </span></span></span></strong><strong><span>申请方式</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>夏令营采用网上报名方式。报名时间：即日起至<span>2026</span>年<span>6</span>月<span>15</span>日<span>24</span>：<span>00</span>。</span></p><p><span>报名分为两步：</span></p><p><span><span>1.<span>  </span></span></span><span>登录浙江大学研究生招生处夏令营报名系统进行报名：<span><span><a href=\"https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login</a></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif\"/><a href=\"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/e6/e4/8302f0544c2f8a572f6053c5fcc1/80ff487e-21dc-4dd3-ad55-0eb5e5705605.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">研究生招生管理系统夏令营模块学生操作手册.pdf</a></span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>2.<span>  </span></span></span><span>报名成功后，填写以下链接报名相关研究方向：<span><span><a href=\"https://jsj.top/f/hKt0DV\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://jsj.top/f/hKt0DV</a></span></span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、<span>   </span></span></span></strong><strong><span>审核及录取</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>物理学院组织相关老师负责营员的审核和选拔，择优录取。营员名单将于<span>6</span>月<span>20</span>日左右在物理学院网站公布（<span>http://physics.zju.edu.cn/</span>）并通过报名系统发布。被录取的同学需在<span>2026</span>年<span>6</span>月<span>23</span>日前在系统中确认是否参加，逾期未确认视为放弃资格。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>四、<span>   </span></span></span></strong><strong><span>报名材料</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>系统报名时需上传：</span></p><p><span><span>1.<span>  </span></span></span><span>近期正面免冠彩色证件照，电子版<span>JPG</span>格式。</span></p><p><span><span>2.<span>  </span></span></span><span>本科阶段成绩单（需加盖教务处或院系公章），<span>PDF</span>格式。</span></p><p><span><span>3.<span>  </span></span></span><span>年级排名证明（需加盖院系公章），<span>PDF</span>格式。</span></p><p><span><span>4.<span>  </span></span></span><span>外语水平证明（<span>CET6</span>、托福、雅思等），<span>PDF</span>格式。</span></p><p><span><span>5.<span>  </span></span></span><span>获奖证书、发表论文等其他相关证明材料，<span>PDF</span>格式。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>被录取的营员需在报到时提交以下纸质材料：</span></p><p><span><span>1.<span>  </span></span></span><span>报名表（网上报名后，系统自动生成）。</span></p><p><span><span>2.<span>  </span></span></span><span>本科阶段成绩单（需加盖教务处或院系公章），原件。</span></p><p><span><span>3.<span>  </span></span></span><span>年级排名证明（需加盖院系公章），原件。</span></p><p><span><span>4.<span>  </span></span></span><span>外语水平证明（<span>CET6</span>、托福、雅思等），复印件。</span></p><p><span><span>5.<span>  </span></span></span><span>其他能体现本人科研能力的材料，如已发表论文、获奖证书、已获得的专利等，复印件。</span></p><p><span><span>6.<span>  </span></span></span><span>2</span><span>封相关专业高级职称专家签名的</span><span></span><span><span><a href=\"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/7e/a0/0aa0ff9d45fa8dce9aefcbdf5e8a/777505dc-2431-42b7-aa24-39afdd20c61c.docx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>专家推荐书.docx</span></span></a></span></span><span>(</span><span>请专家填写并签字后用信封封住，同时在封口处签名）。</span></p><p><span><span>7.<span>  </span></span></span><span>身份证</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>五、<span>   </span></span></span></strong><strong><span>其他说明</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>1</span><span>．夏令营不收注册费。入营期间餐费、往返车票费用、住宿费自理。</span></p><p><span>2. </span><span>参加夏令营的学生必须遵守浙江大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排进行工作和活动，擅自行动将取消营员资格。</span></p><p><span>3</span><span>．<a href=\"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/2026/0601/c69701a3168868/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">欢迎同学们积极与导师联系，充分沟通交流。导师个人主页详见：</a></span></p><p><span>物理学院：<span><span><a href=\"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/ysjs/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://physics.zju.edu.cn/ysjs/list.htm</a></span></span></span></p><p><span>物理高等研究院：<span><span><a href=\"https://physics.zju.edu.cn/iasz/86331/list.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://physics.zju.edu.cn/iasz/86331/list.htm</a></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><br/></span></span></p><p><strong><span> </span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>六、<span>   </span></span></span></strong><strong><span>咨询方式：</span></strong><strong></strong></p><p><span>电话：<span>0571-87953304</span></span></p><p><span>邮箱：<span>phyzll@zju.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>浙江大学物理学院</span></p><p><span>2026</span><span>年<span>6</span>月<span>1</span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"228d5697be3dcd331bbc6efd9ec54c7b9650932bb8ff0cd25549e8e2dd97d3cd","textLength":1272,"sourceSha256":"96b1eb413df531a5e8a88d81b77d1c924101797c4d5e1245d1b27ece541877e8","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-cd5daffaa53e66f57d87","title":"2026年浙江大学物理学院优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:31.280656+00:00"}
